{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id394334281"}, "name":{"label":"apiologies"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-04-30T01:28:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.4.2"}, "id":{"label":"9876708668"}, "title":{"label":"Necessary for all procrastinators"}, "content":{"label":"This is genuinely the most helpful app I’ve found to help with my mindless app-switching throughout the day. Of course, there is nothing that will prevent it completely, but it has saved me a huge amount of time just by implementing something as straight forward as delayed app opening. I’ve had this app since its early days so I’m not restricted by number of apps I can add - some reviews are saying that the free version now only allows 1 app? But I’m not sure. I have 4 apps currently added and it works a charm. Just needs a little set up via Shortcuts but it’s worth it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
