{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id231480838"}, "name":{"label":"Nicola10472973"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-03-29T17:15:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.3.9"}, "id":{"label":"9766107346"}, "title":{"label":"Life changing"}, "content":{"label":"You can’t control your screen time? Even the screen time feature in apple is easy enough to surpass. But then you hear about one sec. Then you set it up and use it for the first time. One sec is just what I needed to quit using social media as much. The breathing exercise is actually so nice and honestly I need the guilt trip of it asking me the question “do you want to open app name?” What a great way to stop me in my tracks. Happily bought a year subscription to this. Will be well worth the money when my habits are changed. I want to take back control of my life.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-10-03T16:33:05-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
